Finally, it is recommended to explore extensions of the analysis in future studies, applying the modeling framework to regional or population disaggregations, as well as incorporating additional macroeconomic variables. This would allow for capturing territorial heterogeneities and improving the sensitivity of the model to relevant external factors.






























